function reportOperationsFullSummary(autoPrint=false){const m=reportMetrics();const si=siIssueMetrics();const bc=siBucketCounts();const sm=shiftReportMetrics();const openTasks=(tasks.tasks||[]).filter(isTaskOpen);const overdue=openTasks.filter(isTaskOverdue);let body=`<div class="report-section report-compact"><div class="report-summary"><strong>Executive Summary:</strong> Operations summary combines staffing, shift reports, Shift Intelligence, tasks, supplies, uniforms, and readiness exceptions. Current data shows ${m.cov.total.openHours} Open/Pending HPW, ${sm.open} open Shift Report issue(s), ${si.needs} Shift Intelligence Needs Action item(s), ${bc.pending} intake item(s), ${openTasks.length} open task(s), and ${overdue.length} overdue task(s).</div>${reportMethodologyNote()}</div><div class="report-section report-compact">${reportKpis([{label:'Open/Pending HPW',value:m.cov.total.openHours},{label:'Shift Reports Imported',value:sm.reports},{label:'Open Report Issues',value:sm.open},{label:'SI Needs Action',value:si.needs},{label:'Pending Intake',value:bc.pending},{label:'Open Tasks',value:openTasks.length},{label:'Overdue Tasks',value:overdue.length},{label:'Supply Exceptions',value:officeSupplyItems(false).filter(i=>['Low','Out','Ordered'].includes(officeSupplyStatus(i))).length}])}</div><div class="report-section"><h2>Command Queue Detail</h2>${reportTable(['Queue','Count','Recommended Use'],[['Coverage Gaps',m.cov.total.openPosts,'Review schedule authority and post coverage'],['Shift Report Open Issues',sm.open,'Close raw issue follow-ups or move meaningful items into Intelligence'],['Shift Intelligence Needs Action',si.needs,'Assign owner/action and manager note'],['Shift Intelligence Recurring',si.recurring,'Escalate or continue monitoring'],['Pending Intake',bc.pending,'Link/create/reference/ignore'],['Open Tasks',openTasks.length,'Update owner, due date, blocker, and current update'],['Uniform Needed',m.uniformNeeded,'Order/issue/replace'],['Training Issues',m.training.issueCount,'Schedule or verify training']].map(r=>[esc(r[0]),r[1],esc(r[2])]))}</div><div class="report-section"><h2>Open Tasks</h2>${reportTable(['Project','Status','Priority','Owner','Due','Next Action'],openTasks.map(t=>[esc(t.project||''),esc(t.status||''),esc(t.priority||''),esc(t.assignedTo||t.owner||''),esc(taskDateShort(t.dueDate)),esc(t.nextAction||t.update||'')]))}</div>`;showReport('Operations Full Summary','Staffing, reports, intelligence, tasks, supplies, uniforms, and readiness in one command report',body,'landscape',autoPrint)}
function runReport(type,autoPrint=false){if(!canAccessReports()){toast('Reports are Admin/Supervisor only');return;}({executive:reportExecutiveBriefing,compliance:reportComplianceReadiness,operations:reportOperationsFullSummary,shiftintel:reportShiftIntelligenceSummary,weekly:reportWeeklyStaffing,labor:reportLaborCost,coverage:reportCoverageGap,attendance:reportAttendanceSummary,'attendance-actions':reportAttendanceAction,'attendance-trends':reportAttendanceTrendRisk,training:reportTrainingReadiness,uniforms:reportUniformStatus,supplies:reportOfficeSupplies,tasks:reportTaskStatus}[type]||reportWeeklyStaffing)(autoPrint)}
